{"ID":"20240220132632-i794iux","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132632-i794iux","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132632-i794iux\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162021-hy9715v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162707-57v5lbi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162707-57v5lbi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【栀子生姜豆豉汤】（栀子生姜豉汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312162707"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312162021-hy9715v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-hy9715v","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第八十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-19n0trc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-19n0trc","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：发汗吐下后,虚烦不得眠,若剧者,必反复颠倒,心中懊憹,「栀子豉汤」主之。若少气者,「栀子甘草豉汤」主之。若呕者,「栀子生姜豉汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-sub63i1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-sub63i1","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「栀子豉汤」都是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病愈了以后，人没办法睡觉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，「栀子豉汤」是去虚烦用的。若呕者,「栀子生姜豉汤」主之，生姜能够止呕。所以说轻微的药，你看那个栀子、豆豉，并不是真正治疗重病的药，所以是病后调理的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-0xvlpcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-0xvlpcm","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3——1"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-bfq6pvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-bfq6pvm","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么用栀子，栀子去虚热，跟黄连、黄芪不一样。栀子也是苦味，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子是栀子花，质很轻。黄连、黄芪是根，质很重。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"质重大部分都跑到很深的地方去。栀子质很轻，所以它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"是虚烦，并不是实症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，人已经好了嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-kv91ai1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-kv91ai1","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"必反复颠倒,心中懊憹,为什么用豆豉？豆豉能够生胃的津液。只要用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“心中”，大部分都是讲的胃的地方，伤寒论讲到胃的话，大部分是指肠的地方，往下移一个位置。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心中懊憹,就是胃里面怪怪的。刚开始虚症的失眠，我们会用到栀子豆豉汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-4bz3tyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-4bz3tyg","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚症实症分辨。摸脉，脉按下去就没有了，脉来的很虚，他就是虚，舌苔，淡黄色。实热舌苔是黄，而且是干裂。“反复颠倒”，他又讲不出来，一下说这边不舒服，一下说那边。这是病要痊愈，伤到一些津液，就会产生这种现象。弥补的方式栀子豉汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-6jqt7tb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-6jqt7tb","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少气，元气不够，四肢没有力量。同样的药，加了一个甘草。张仲景在用滋补的药，甘草一味药而已。甘草、红枣、人参、白芍都是张仲景常常用的滋补的药。少气用甘草，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草除了入脾脏，入肠胃生津液以外，最主要担心肠胃有坏死的食物，所以甘草下去解百毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-iumqtid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-iumqtid","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若呕者，张仲景有时候用生姜，有时用干姜，有时用生半夏。生姜跟半夏不一样，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景大部分用生半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，但他用生半夏都放生姜在里面，生姜可以解半夏的毒，会用到半夏都是会有停水，也就是说胃里面有水，经方观念里面，水可以生万物，可以滋养你，也可以生病。正常人的水在身体里，是气化的水，也就是热的。一旦发现是冷水，这个水要排掉。不排掉新水不会出来。所以有时候津液不够，大量喝水下去，胃里面火很小，元气刚刚恢复，大量的水下去，胃里面会停水。有时治病的时候，病人一下恢复了，当病人本来是不口渴的，你把他治的开始口渴了，这都是好转的现象，口渴好像原来没有胃口，吃了药以后胃口来了。我们可以知道他好转了。口渴，少少与之，你刚刚恢复，不要大量喝水，病人不知道，拿起水就喝，才刚刚起来的微火，一下就浇灭掉了，这个时候胃里会有停水。停水，半夏才能利出来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用半夏一定是确定胃里面有水，才会用半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个水如果不去掉，是冷水的话，肠胃里有宿食在里面，这个宿食碰到寒水，食物发酵烂掉了，这个时候，很快的用半夏把水利掉。这里不用半夏，因为津液才刚刚回来，你用半夏把津液利掉不好。所以用生姜。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜可以止呕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。女人，干姜、生半夏、人参，他吃完就不吐了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-0aypdcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-0aypdcz","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人只有呕吐没有下痢，使用栀子生姜豉汤。如果有下痢就是葛芩连汤，葛根黄芩黄连甘草。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-ywzio7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-ywzio7r","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子豉汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-1gerqle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-1gerqle","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桅子十四枚劈，香豉四合绵裹。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-2gka4qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-2gka4qk","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味,以水四升,先煮栀于得二升半,内豉,煮取一升半,去滓,分温二服。栀子一般五钱,豆豉也是五钱,不要把豆豉煮烂掉了,所以先煮栀子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-oqgiq4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-oqgiq4z","updated":"20240312162021"}},{"ID":"20240312162021-vbwcu5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-vbwcu5d","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子甘草豉汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-9jgh32p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-9jgh32p","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子十四枚，甘草二两，香豉四合。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-55qdboz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-55qdboz","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味,以水四升,先煮栀子、甘草，得二升半,内豉,煮取一升半,去滓,分温二服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162021-ndgrw0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162021-ndgrw0s","updated":"20240312162021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栀子用五钱,甘草二钱,豆豉也是五钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162423-hpm816c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162423-hpm816c"}},{"ID":"20240312162423-u1i7su4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162423-u1i7su4","updated":"20240312162638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子生姜豉汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162435-xz2t8hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162435-xz2t8hr","updated":"20240312162640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子十四枚劈\t生姜五两\t香豉四合（棉裹）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162507-u8oz049","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162507-u8oz049","updated":"20240312162641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水四升，先煮栀子生姜取二升半，纳豉煮取一升半，去滓，分二服，温进一服，得吐者止后服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162609-rws0cc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162609-rws0cc5","updated":"20240312162641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"发汗，若下之，而烦热，胸中窒者，栀子豉汤主之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162707-57v5lbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162707-57v5lbi"}}]}